118 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 90 0 R
/T (The banking industry relies heavily on multi-dimensional customer behavioural data to assess creditworthiness, customer retention, and portfolio risk. This project presents the Bank Customer Financial Health Analysis System, a Python-based analytical dashboard designed to evaluate, categorize, and visualize individual and aggregate client financial profiles.  By integrating Pandas for structured data handling, NumPy for vectorized mathematical aggregations, and Matplotlib embedded within a native Tkinter desktop interface, the system translates raw tabular metrics into intuitive graphical and diagnostic reports.)
/E (The banking industry relies heavily on multi-dimensional customer behavioural data to assess creditworthiness, customer retention, and portfolio risk. This project presents the Bank Customer Financial Health Analysis System, a Python-based analytical dashboard designed to evaluate, categorize, and visualize individual and aggregate client financial profiles.  By integrating Pandas for structured data handling, NumPy for vectorized mathematical aggregations, and Matplotlib embedded within a native Tkinter desktop interface, the system translates raw tabular metrics into intuitive graphical and diagnostic reports.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
